nd managing project plans; negotiating and managing project schedules and resource forecasts; and managing project financials and deliverables.","source_heading":"Essential Responsibilities","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"job_duty","requirement_level":null,"item_text":"Drives compliance with regulatory, statutory, and legal controls by developing and coordinating policies and procedures to achieve compliance and control objectives (e.g., audit controls, financial commitments, etc.).","source_heading":"Essential Responsibilities","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"job_duty","requirement_level":null,"item_text":"Manages vendor contracts and transactions (e.g., lease agreements, investment portfolios, etc.) for complex, high-impact initiatives by actively building and managing a network of strategic/financial/business partners; negotiating and reviewing financial agreements in accordance with regulatory policies and guidelines; identifying and evaluating key performance indicators; and ensuring vendor performance meets established service level agreements.","source_heading":"Essential Responsibilities","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"skill","requirement_level":null,"item_text":"Ambiguity/Uncertainty Management","source_heading":"Knowledge, Skills and Abilities: (Core)","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"skill","requirement_level":null,"item_text":"Analytical Skills","source_heading":"Knowledge, Skills and Abilities: (Functional)","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"skill","requirement_level":null,"item_text":"Attention to Detail","source_heading":"Knowledge, Skills and Abilities: (Core)","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"skill","requirement_level":null,"item_text":"Debugging and Troubleshooting","source_heading":"Knowledge, Skills and Abilities: (Functional)","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"skill","requirement_level":null,"item_text":"Business Knowledge","source_heading":"Knowledge, Skills and Abilities: (Core)","source_subh